# Negate counters target noncreature spell. Bot1 holds up an Island and Mox Sapphire. Bot2's Llanowar Elves is a
# creature spell, so Negate is not offered against it (the refusal); Bot2's Lightning Bolt aimed at Bot1 two turns
# later is countered, and Bot1 stays at 20 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Negate
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Forest x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
? Stack = Llanowar Elves
! Bot1.Hand.Negate.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Negate.Cast(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Negate
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 3
